# Firebase web config for the "anchorchet" project.
#
# These are NOT secrets. Vite inlines every VITE_* var into the client bundle at
# build time, and Firebase web config is a public identifier by design — the
# access boundary is firestore.rules (a UID allowlist), not this file.
